{"id": "1t-1-1", "courseId": "1t", "chapterNumber": "1.1", "title": "Ovddabealmearkkat ja rehkenastinvuorru", "description": "Oahpa rehkenastima negatiiva loguiguin, ovddabealmearkanjuolggadusaid ja rivttes rehkenastinvuoru birra.", "estimatedMinutes": 45, "competenceGoals": ["čađahit rehkenastimiid negatiiva loguiguin", "geavahit rivttes rehkenastinvuoru"], "content": [{"id": "1t-1-1-intro", "type": "text", "content": "## Lasiheapmi ja eretváldin (plussa ja minus)\n\nGo rehkenastit negatiiva loguiguin, fertet leat dárkil ovddabealmearkkaiguin. Dá leat muhtun dehálaš njuolggadusat:\n\n- Minus ruođu ovddabealde mas lea negatiiva lohku addá plussa: $a - (-b) = a + b$\n- Plussa ruođu ovddabealde mas lea negatiiva lohku addá minus: $a + (-b) = a - b$"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-example-1", "type": "example", "title": "Ovdamearka 1", "problem": "Rehkenaste:\n\na) $5 + 2$\nb) $9 - 4$\nc) $-5 + 17$\nd) $-10 + 3$\ne) $5 - (-3)$\nf) $-10 - 12$\ng) $5 + (-9)$\nh) $9 - 8 - 16$", "solution": "**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $5 + 2 = 7$\n\nb) $9 - 4 = 5$\n\nc) $-5 + 17 = 17 - 5 = 12$\n\nd) $-10 + 3 = 3 - 10 = -7$\n\ne) $5 - (-3) = 5 + 3 = 8$\n\nf) $-10 - 12 = -22$\n\ng) $5 + (-9) = 5 - 9 = -4$\n\nh) $9 - 8 - 16 = 1 - 16 = -15$", "solutionVideo": "vHyvQ6CYZ9Q"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-1", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-1", "number": "1-1", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "lett", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$9 + 8$", "solution": "$9 + 8 = 17$", "answer": 17}, {"label": "b", "task": "$12 - 8$", "solution": "$12 - 8 = 4$", "answer": 4}, {"label": "c", "task": "$-5 + 10$", "solution": "$-5 + 10 = 5$", "answer": 5}, {"label": "d", "task": "$(-3) + 20$", "solution": "$(-3) + 20 = 17$", "answer": 17}, {"label": "e", "task": "$-10 - 11$", "solution": "$-10 - 11 = -21$", "answer": -21}, {"label": "f", "task": "$-4 - (-2)$", "solution": "$-4 - (-2) = -4 + 2 = -2$", "answer": -2}], "solution": "a) 17, b) 4, c) 5, d) 17, e) −21, f) −2", "hints": ["Muitte ahte minus ruođu ovddabealde mas lea negatiiva lohku addá plussa"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-2", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-2", "number": "1-2", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "lett", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$-20 - (-8)$", "solution": "$-20 - (-8) = -20 + 8 = -12$", "answer": -12}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-4 + (-2)$", "solution": "$-4 + (-2) = -4 - 2 = -6$", "answer": -6}, {"label": "c", "task": "$-3 - 5 - 3$", "solution": "$-3 - 5 - 3 = -11$", "answer": -11}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-7 + (-8) - (-10)$", "solution": "$-7 + (-8) - (-10) = -7 - 8 + 10 = -5$", "answer": -5}, {"label": "e", "task": "$-4 - 20 + 3$", "solution": "$-4 - 20 + 3 = -21$", "answer": -21}, {"label": "f", "task": "$-30 - (-20) + (-10)$", "solution": "$-30 - (-20) + (-10) = -30 + 20 - 10 = -20$", "answer": -20}], "solution": "a) −12, b) −6, c) −11, d) −5, e) −21, f) −20", "hints": ["Váldde dan lávki lávkái ja váruha ovddabealmearkkaiguin"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-mult-intro", "type": "text", "content": "## Geardun ja juohkin\n\nGo geardut ja juohkit negatiiva loguiguin, sáhtát lohkat galle negatiiva ovddabealmearkka leat gávdnan dihte bohtosa ovddabealmearkka:\n\n- **Leaskalohku** minusiid mearri → boađus lea **negatiiva**\n- **Bárralohku** minusiid mearri → boađus lea **positiiva**"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-example-2", "type": "example", "title": "Ovdamearka 2", "problem": "Rehkenaste:\n\na) $2 \\cdot (-4)$\nb) $(-3) \\cdot (-4)$\nc) $-5 \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-3)$", "solution": "**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $2 \\cdot (-4) = -8$ (Okta negatiiva ovddabealmearka (leaskalohku) addá negatiiva bohtosa)\n\nb) $(-3) \\cdot (-4) = 12$ (Guokte negatiiva ovddabealmearkka (bárralohku) addá positiiva bohtosa)\n\nc) $-5 \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-3) = 10 \\cdot (-3) = -30$ (Golbma negatiiva ovddabealmearkka (leaskalohku) addá negatiiva bohtosa)", "solutionVideo": "xVbz_Aj-Kxo"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-3", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-3", "number": "2", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "lett", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$-2 \\cdot (-3)$", "solution": "$-2 \\cdot (-3) = 6$", "answer": 6}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-4 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 3$", "solution": "$-4 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 3 = -24$", "answer": -24}, {"label": "c", "task": "$(-3) \\cdot (-4) \\cdot (-1)$", "solution": "$(-3) \\cdot (-4) \\cdot (-1) = -12$", "answer": -12}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-7 \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-1) \\cdot (-2)$", "solution": "$-7 \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-1) \\cdot (-2) = 28$", "answer": 28}, {"label": "e", "task": "$3 \\cdot (-1{,}5) \\cdot 2$", "solution": "$3 \\cdot (-1{,}5) \\cdot 2 = -9$", "answer": -9}, {"label": "f", "task": "$-3 \\cdot (-1{,}5) \\cdot (-2)$", "solution": "$-3 \\cdot (-1{,}5) \\cdot (-2) = -9$", "answer": -9}], "solution": "a) 6, b) −24, c) −12, d) 28, e) −9, f) −9", "hints": ["Loga galle negatiiva ovddabealmearkka leat gávdnan dihte bohtosa ovddabealmearkka"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-example-3", "type": "example", "title": "Ovdamearka 3", "problem": "Rehkenaste:\n\na) $20 \\div 2$\n\nb) $(-30) \\div (-3)$\n\nc) $\\frac{-15}{5}$\n\nd) $\\frac{80}{-16}$", "solution": "**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $20 \\div 2 = 10$\n\nb) $(-30) \\div (-3) = 10$\n\nc) $\\frac{-15}{5} = \\frac{-1 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 1} = -3$\n\nd) $\\frac{80}{-16} = \\frac{8 \\cdot 10}{-1 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 8} = \\frac{10}{-2} = -5$", "solutionVideo": "TO6m5GOZedE"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-4", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-4", "number": "3", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "lett", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$30 \\div 3$", "solution": "$30 \\div 3 = 10$", "answer": 10}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-20 \\div 5$", "solution": "$-20 \\div 5 = -4$", "answer": -4}, {"label": "c", "task": "$\\frac{-100}{5}$", "solution": "$\\frac{-100}{5} = -20$", "answer": -20}, {"label": "d", "task": "$\\frac{100}{-5}$", "solution": "$\\frac{100}{-5} = -20$", "answer": -20}, {"label": "e", "task": "$\\frac{-30}{-10}$", "solution": "$\\frac{-30}{-10} = 3$", "answer": 3}, {"label": "f", "task": "$-\\frac{-15}{-5}$", "solution": "$-\\frac{-15}{-5} = -\\frac{15}{5} = -3$", "answer": -3}], "solution": "a) 10, b) −4, c) −20, d) −20, e) 3, f) −3", "hints": ["Muitte ovddabealmearkanjuolggadusaid juohkima várás"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-potens-intro", "type": "text", "content": "## Poteanssat ja negatiiva ovddabealmearkkat\n\nLea dehálaš earuhit $(-2)^3$ ja $-2^3$ gaskka:\n\n$(-2)^3 = (-2) \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-2)$ → Dás leat 3 negatiiva ovddabealmearkka, nu ahte boađus šaddá negatiiva: $-8$\n\n$-2^3 = -2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2$ → Dás lea dušše okta negatiiva ovddabealmearka. Boađus šaddá ain negatiiva: $-8$\n\nMuhto bárralohkoeksponeanttaid várás lea erohus:\n\n$(-2)^4 = (-2) \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-2) = 16$ (positiiva)\n\n$-2^4 = -(2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2) = -16$ (negatiiva)"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-example-4", "type": "example", "title": "Ovdamearka 4", "problem": "Rehkenaste:\n\na) $(-2)^4$ (Dás leat 4 negatiiva ovddabealmearkka gerdojuvvon, nu ahte boađus šaddá positiiva)\nb) $(-3) \\cdot (-2)^2$ (Dás lea $(-2)^2 = 4$ positiiva, nu ahte mii geardut ovtta negatiiva logu positiivvain)", "solution": "**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $(-2)^4 = (-2) \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-2) \\cdot (-2) = 16$\n\nb) $(-3) \\cdot (-2)^2 = (-3) \\cdot 4 = -12$ (Dás lea $(-2)^2 = 4$ positiiva danin go eksponeanta lea bárralohku. Nu mii geardut ovtta negatiiva logu positiivvain, ja boađus šaddá negatiiva.)", "solutionVideo": "J_L1U-hzmJk"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-5", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-5", "number": "4", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "medium", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$(-5)^2$", "solution": "$(-5)^2 = 25$", "answer": 25}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-4 \\cdot 3^2$", "solution": "$-4 \\cdot 3^2 = -4 \\cdot 9 = -36$", "answer": -36}, {"label": "c", "task": "$(-3)^3$", "solution": "$(-3)^3 = -27$", "answer": -27}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-7 \\cdot (-2)^2$", "solution": "$-7 \\cdot (-2)^2 = -7 \\cdot 4 = -28$", "answer": -28}, {"label": "e", "task": "$(-5)^2 \\cdot (-2)^2$", "solution": "$(-5)^2 \\cdot (-2)^2 = 25 \\cdot 4 = 100$", "answer": 100}, {"label": "f", "task": "$(-2)^3 \\cdot (-5)^2$", "solution": "$(-2)^3 \\cdot (-5)^2 = -8 \\cdot 25 = -200$", "answer": -200}], "solution": "a) 25, b) −36, c) −27, d) −28, e) 100, f) −200", "hints": ["Loga galle negatiiva ovddabealmearkka gerdojuvvojit oktii"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-rot-intro", "type": "text", "content": "## Nubbiruohttasat\n\nLogu $a$ nubbiruohtas lea dat positiiva lohku mii iežainis gerdojuvvon addá $a$.\n\n**Dehálaš:** Mii eat sáhte váldit negatiiva loguid nubbiruohttasa (reála loguin)."}, {"id": "1t-1-1-example-5", "type": "example", "title": "Ovdamearka 5", "problem": "Rehkenaste:\n\na) $\\sqrt{9}$\nb) $-\\sqrt{100}$\nc) $\\sqrt{-64}$", "solution": "**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\sqrt{9} = \\sqrt{3 \\cdot 3} = \\sqrt{3^2} = 3$\n\nb) $-\\sqrt{100} = -\\sqrt{10^2} = -10$\n\nc) $\\sqrt{-64}$ → Ii makkárge čoavddus (Mii eat sáhte váldit negatiiva loguid nubbiruohttasa)", "solutionVideo": "4JiJTSIM0n8"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-6", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-6", "number": "5", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "medium", "task": "Rehkenaste jos vejolaš", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$\\sqrt{4}$", "solution": "$\\sqrt{4} = 2$", "answer": 2}, {"label": "b", "task": "$\\sqrt{36}$", "solution": "$\\sqrt{36} = 6$", "answer": 6}, {"label": "c", "task": "$\\sqrt{-25}$", "solution": "Ii makkárge čoavddus (ii sáhte váldit negatiiva loguid nubbiruohttasa)"}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-\\sqrt{64}$", "solution": "$-\\sqrt{64} = -8$", "answer": -8}, {"label": "e", "task": "$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{81}}$", "solution": "$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{81}} = \\sqrt{9} = 3$", "answer": 3}, {"label": "f", "task": "$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{25} - \\sqrt{16}}$", "solution": "$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{25} - \\sqrt{16}} = \\sqrt{5 - 4} = \\sqrt{1} = 1$", "answer": 1}], "solution": "a) 2, b) 6, c) Ii čoavddus, d) −8, e) 3, f) 1", "hints": ["Muitte ahte mii eat sáhte váldit negatiiva loguid nubbiruohttasa"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-rekkefolge-intro", "type": "text", "content": "## Rehkenastinvuorru\n\nGo mis leat máŋga rehkenastinoperašuvnna seamma cealkagis, fertet čuovvut rehkenastinvuoru:\n\n1. **Ruođut** – Rehkenaste vuos dan mii lea ruođuid siste\n2. **Poteanssat ja ruohttasat**\n3. **Geardun ja juohkin** – Gurutbeale olgešbeallái\n4. **Lasiheapmi ja eretváldin** – Gurutbeale olgešbeallái\n\n**Muitinnjuolggadus:** \"**P**lease **E**xcuse **M**y **D**ear **A**unt **S**ally\" (Parentheses, Exponents, Multiplication/Division, Addition/Subtraction)"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-example-6", "type": "example", "title": "Ovdamearka 6", "problem": "Rehkenaste:\n\na) $10 - 3 \\cdot 3$\nb) $20 - (3\\sqrt{4} \\div 2)$\nc) $2^3 - (7 - 3)^2$", "solution": "**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $10 - 3 \\cdot 3 = 10 - 9 = 1$\n\nb) $20 - (3\\sqrt{4} \\div 2) = 20 - (3 \\cdot 2 \\div 2) = 20 - (6 \\div 2) = 20 - 3 = 17$\n\nc) $2^3 - (7 - 3)^2 = 8 - 4^2 = 8 - 16 = -8$", "solutionVideo": "4JiJTSIM0n8"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-7", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-7", "number": "6-1", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "medium", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$10 - 2 \\cdot 4$", "solution": "$10 - 2 \\cdot 4 = 10 - 8 = 2$", "answer": 2}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-4 \\cdot 3 + 2$", "solution": "$-4 \\cdot 3 + 2 = -12 + 2 = -10$", "answer": -10}, {"label": "c", "task": "$(-3) \\cdot \\sqrt{25} + (-10)$", "solution": "$(-3) \\cdot \\sqrt{25} + (-10) = -3 \\cdot 5 - 10 = -15 - 10 = -25$", "answer": -25}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-28 \\div (-2) + (-2)^4$", "solution": "$-28 \\div (-2) + (-2)^4 = 14 + 16 = 30$", "answer": 30}, {"label": "e", "task": "$(3 + \\sqrt{9} \\cdot 2)^2 - 2$", "solution": "$(3 + \\sqrt{9} \\cdot 2)^2 - 2 = (3 + 3 \\cdot 2)^2 - 2 = (3 + 6)^2 - 2 = 9^2 - 2 = 81 - 2 = 79$", "answer": 79}, {"label": "f", "task": "$3^{\\sqrt{4+1}} - 2 \\cdot 5$", "solution": "$3^{\\sqrt{4+1}} - 2 \\cdot 5 = 3^{\\sqrt{5}} - 10 \\approx 11{,}6 - 10 \\approx 1{,}6$"}], "solution": "a) 2, b) −10, c) −25, d) 30, e) 79, f) ≈ 1,6", "hints": ["Muitte čuovvut rehkenastinvuoru: ruođut, poteanssat/ruohttasat, geardun/juohkin, plussa/minus"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-block-8", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-ex-8", "number": "6-2", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "vanskelig", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$(3 - 2 \\cdot 4) \\cdot 2 - 3$", "solution": "$(3 - 2 \\cdot 4) \\cdot 2 - 3 = (3 - 8) \\cdot 2 - 3 = -5 \\cdot 2 - 3 = -10 - 3 = -13$", "answer": -13}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-2 \\cdot (3 - 5)^2 + 2$", "solution": "$-2 \\cdot (3 - 5)^2 + 2 = -2 \\cdot (-2)^2 + 2 = -2 \\cdot 4 + 2 = -8 + 2 = -6$", "answer": -6}, {"label": "c", "task": "$(-1) \\cdot (\\sqrt{16} - 2^3)$", "solution": "$(-1) \\cdot (\\sqrt{16} - 2^3) = (-1) \\cdot (4 - 8) = (-1) \\cdot (-4) = 4$", "answer": 4}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-40 \\div (-2^3) + 3^3$", "solution": "$-40 \\div (-2^3) + 3^3 = -40 \\div (-8) + 27 = 5 + 27 = 32$", "answer": 32}, {"label": "e", "task": "$(2\\sqrt{49} - 7)^2 + 1$", "solution": "$(2\\sqrt{49} - 7)^2 + 1 = (2 \\cdot 7 - 7)^2 + 1 = (14 - 7)^2 + 1 = 7^2 + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50$", "answer": 50}, {"label": "f", "task": "$(5^2 - 5) \\cdot 5$", "solution": "$(5^2 - 5) \\cdot 5 = (25 - 5) \\cdot 5 = 20 \\cdot 5 = 100$", "answer": 100}], "solution": "a) −13, b) −6, c) 4, d) 32, e) 50, f) 100", "hints": ["Álgge siskkimus ruođuin ja bargga olggos guvlui"], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-tillegg", "type": "collapsible", "title": "Lassebihtát", "buttonText": "Čájet 