: "1t-1-1-oppsummering", "type": "text", "content": "## Čoahkkáigeassu\n\n- **Lasiheapmi ja eretváldin negatiiva loguiguin:** $a - (-b) = a + b$ ja $a + (-b) = a - b$\n- **Ovddabealmearkanjuolggadusat geardumii/juohkimii:** Leaskalohku negatiiva ovddabealmearkkaid mearri addá negatiiva bohtosa, bárralohku negatiiva ovddabealmearkkaid mearri addá positiiva bohtosa\n- **Poteanssat negatiiva loguiguin:** $(-a)^n$ lea positiiva jos $n$ lea bárralohku, negatiiva jos $n$ lea leaskalohku. Váruha erohusa $(-2)^2 = 4$ ja $-2^2 = -4$ gaskka\n- **Nubbiruohttasat:** $\\sqrt{a^2} = a$ positiiva loguid várás. Mii eat sáhte váldit negatiiva loguid nubbiruohttasa (reála loguin)\n- **Rehkenastinvuorru (PEMDAS):** 1) Ruođut, 2) Poteanssat ja ruohttasat, 3) Geardun ja juohkin (gurutbeale), 4) Lasiheapmi ja eretváldin (gurutbeale)\n- Muitte álo dahkat seamma operašuvnna goappašiid beliid ovttamáđatmearkka guoras"}, {"id": "1t-1-1-repetisjon", "type": "collapsible", "title": "Geardduhanbihtát", "buttonText": "Čájet geardduhanbihtáid", "content": [{"id": "1t-1-1-rep-1", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-rep-ex-1", "number": "R1", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "lett", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$-3 + 7$", "answer": 4}, {"label": "b", "task": "$-5 - 8$", "answer": -13}, {"label": "c", "task": "$6 - (-4)$", "answer": 10}, {"label": "d", "task": "$-7 - (-7)$", "answer": 0}], "solution": "a) $4$, b) $-13$, c) $10$, d) $0$", "hideInlineSolution": true, "hints": ["Negatiiva logu eret váldin lea seamma go lasiheapmi: $a - (-b) = a + b$."], "allowsUpload": true, "allowsCanvasDrawing": true}}, {"id": "1t-1-1-rep-2", "type": "exercise", "exercise": {"id": "1t-1-1-rep-ex-2", "number": "R2", "type": "classic", "difficulty": "lett", "task": "Rehkenaste", "subTasks": [{"label": "a", "task": "$(-3) \\cdot 4$", "answer": -12}, {"label": "b", "task": "$(-6) \\cdot (-5)$", "answer": 30}, {"label": "c", "task": "$\\frac{-24}{6}$", "answer": -4}, {"label": "d",